# ── Runtime state (never committed) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# config/ is seeded from resources/ on first run and is entirely local: the live
# config.yaml, .env, SQLite DB, pictures, temp media and IPC files.
# Leading slash = repo root only. A bare "snapchat/" would also match
# app/platforms/snapchat/, excluding the Node runner source from the repo.
/config/
/ipc/
/logs/
/backups/
/data/
/snapchat/
/bin/
# A folder named "portable" beside the app is the opt in that makes it keep all
# of its state inside its own folder, so it holds exactly what /config/ holds.
/portable/
/webview/
*.flag
**/*-cookies.json

# ── Secrets, belt and braces in case config/ is ever un-ignored ──────────────
# `.env` matches the live file only; resources/example.env is the committed
# template and is deliberately NOT matched by these.
.env
.env.*
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
webui/dist/
build/
dist/
# Covers the PyInstaller binaries and the Inno Setup installer, which
# installer.iss writes to the repo root.
*.exe

# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.py[co]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# ── Tool caches ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── OS / editor cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log

# ── Scratch and merge leftovers ───────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej

# ── Owner's own notes, not part of the project ────────────────────────────────
# Without this, git add . would publish it.
/donotread.txt

# Written by the build from the git tag, read by app/version.py.
# Generated per build, never committed.
app/_build.py
